         Mission Statement It is our intention to continue to work on bringing the City Clerk’s office into the 21 st  Century. We continue to greet residents with a smile on our faces, a welcoming tone, and a spring in our step. The Clerk’s office is the first window that residents will approach and we here always take pride in assisting them with whatever their needs may be.  Services Administers the oath of office to all elected and appointed officials Collect payment for all non-criminal fines including but not limited to rubbish & recycling, dog fines, and false alarm fines Issues Marriage Licenses, Dog Licenses, Class 1, 2, and 3 Auto licenses, Common Victualler, and Lodging licenses Issues permits for raffles and bazaars, fuel storage, Hawkers and Peddlers, and Keeping a Stand Notary Services by appointment only  Post meetings of all governmental bodies Provides access to public records Records and certifies planning and zoning board decisions Records and provides certified copies of birth, death and marriage records Records business certificates Responds to inquiries from general public Sale of parking passes for municipal lots 
     

 
